omen x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0GJ5K453Y?smid=AI82NIR75OLEX&psc=1\n- GORGECRAFT 3Pcs 3 Styles Wood Fish Wall Decor Wooden Nautical Coastal Beach Fishes Wall Sculpture Vintage Ocean Lake House Art Hanging Decorations for Bathroom Home Outdoor Party Crafts x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0DZP2PRKW?smid=A2NKGPD52GAIII&psc=1\n- Forreen 3Pcs Wooden Beach Ornament Kit, Sailboat Decor,Wooden Boat Maritime Little Boats Ornaments,Home Ornament,for Bathroom Bedroom Office x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0FCC1WPMW?smid=APTQRJKA8OYV3&psc=1\n- Minton & Donello - Organic Mung Beans, Perfect for Healthy Dishes, High in Nutrients, 500g (Pack of 2) x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0G4ZTYKV8?smid=A3P5ROKL5A1OLE&th=1\n- Natures Root Organic Broccoli Sprouting Seeds 500g - Superfood | Non GMO | Microgreen Sprouts x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B07D19NVXK?smid=A3R629B0132YJF&th=1\n- Oatly Oat Drink Long Life Single Serve 20ml (Pack of 100) x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0D1C51QR3?smid=A3P5ROKL5A1OLE&th=1\n- Prestige Inspire Bakeware Loaf Tin, 2lb - Black x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B00AB1DUTQ?smid=A3P5ROKL5A1OLE&th=1\n- Hisredsun Seed Sprouting Jar Kit, 2pcs 1000ml Wide Mouth Quart Mason Jars with Stainless Steel Screen Sprout Lids,86mm Caliber,with Tray,Stand,Shading Cloth and Canning Brush,for Making Seeds Sprouts x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B09C21P2R6?smid=A1RMS6ML5OJTFK&th=1\n- SkySprouts Pea Shoot Seeds - Organic 1kg x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0CHSC5F2X?smid=A2GA8UMSN8K7IZ&th=1\n- Command Picture Hanging Strips, Value Pack - 10 Pairs of Small (20 Strips), 8 Pairs of Medium (16 Strips) Adhesive Strips - for Pictures & Frames in Different Sizes - Damage Free Hanging x 2 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B07H54NZ34?smid=A3P5ROKL5A1OLE&th=1\n- Brabantia Ironing Board A, 110x30cm - Denim Grey | 100% Fairtrade Cotton | Compact & Stable Design | Adjustable Height & Steam Iron Rest | Child & Transport Locks x 1 (Amazon UK) - https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0DVZNY2RF?smid=A3P5ROKL5A1OLE&th=1\r\n\r\nThe items listed above are now available for collection.\n\nIf your order includes other items, we will notify you separately as soon as they arrive.\r\n\r\nCollection reference: Order 26355\r\n\r\nCollection location:\r\nDabba Direct\r\nUnit 18, New Harbours Yard\r\nGibraltar\r\n\r\nCollection hours:\r\nMon–Fri 10:00 – 16:00\r\n\r\nGoogle Maps:\r\nhttps://maps.google.com/?q=Dabba+Direct+Gibraltar\r\n\r\nIf you require home delivery, please reply directly to this email.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nThe Dabba Direct Team','2026-05-15 10:30:17',NULL,NULL,2,2,'2026-05-15 10:30:17','2026-05-15 10:30:17');
