ey arrive.\r\n\r\nCollection reference: Order 26369\r\n\r\nCollection location:\r\nDabba Direct\r\nUnit 18, New Harbours Yard\r\nGibraltar\r\n\r\nCollection hours:\r\nMon–Fri 10:00 – 16:00\r\n\r\nGoogle Maps:\r\nhttps://maps.google.com/?q=Dabba+Direct+Gibraltar\r\n\r\nIf you require home delivery, please reply directly to this email.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nThe Dabba Direct Team','2026-05-22 10:15:43',NULL,NULL,2,2,'2026-05-22 10:15:43','2026-05-22 10:15:43');
