                      <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-radius:6px; background-color:#2563eb;\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Dabba+Direct+Gibraltar\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:14px; font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; color:#ffffff; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; padding:12px 20px; border:1px solid #2563eb; display:inline-block;\">Open in Google Maps →</a>\r\n                                    </td>\r\n                                </tr>\r\n                            </table>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n\r\n    <p style=\"margin:32px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#475569;\">\r\n        If you require home delivery, please reply directly to this email and our team will be happy to arrange it.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style=\"margin:24px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#475569;\">\r\n        Kind regards,<br>\r\n        <strong style=\"color:#0f172a;\">The Dabba Direct Team</strong>\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 32px; background:#f1f5f9; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#64748b; text-align:center;\">\r\n    Please remember to bring your collection reference (Order #26285) when picking up your items.\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','Dear Stacey McMahon,\r\n\r\nGood news - some items from your order have arrived and are now ready to collect.\r\n\r\n- Nesting Side Table Set of 2, Industrial Round Nest of Tables BROWN x 1 (Debenhams) - https://www.debenhams.com/product/homcom-nesting-side-table-set-of-2-industrial-round-nest-of-tables_p-46299eec-68d4-4b3c-8176-203dcb4ec7ce?colour=Brown\r\n\r\nThe items listed above are now available for collection.\n\nIf your order includes other items, we will notify you separately as soon as they arrive.\r\n\r\nCollection reference: Order 26285\r\n\r\nCollection location:\r\nDabba Direct\r\nUnit 18, New Harbours Yard\r\nGibraltar\r\n\r\nCollection hours:\r\nMon–Fri 10:00 – 16:00\r\n\r\nGoogle Maps:\r\nhttps://maps.google.com/?q=Dabba+Direct+Gibraltar\r\n\r\nIf you require home delivery, please reply directly to this email.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nThe Dabba Direct Team','2026-06-11 11:41:19',NULL,NULL,5,5,'2026-06-11 11:41:19','2026-06-11 11:41:19'),
